{"id":"85eb63f521635a97","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-readonceoracleedge.md","title":"One-query co-occurrence test from dual prime supports","display":"thm-readonceoracleedge — One-query co-occurrence test from dual prime supports","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-readonceoracleedge","aliases":["27-thm-readonceoracleedge"],"display":"thm-readonceoracleedge — One-query co-occurrence test from dual prime supports","depends_on":["[[27-df-cooccurrence]]","[[27-df-minmaxsupport]]","[[27-df-readoncefunc]]","[[27-thm-gurvich]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.6 Lemma 10.6 and steps C.1–C.2","source_printed_pages":"475","source_pdf_pages":"499","verification_status":"source-lemma-checked-and-exercise-proof-reconstructed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-readonceoracleedge"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-readonceoracleedge</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-readonceoracleedge — One-query co-occurrence test from dual prime supports"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f58350b3b48133a\" href=\"?note=7f58350b3b48133a\" title=\"27-df-cooccurrence\">27-df-cooccurrence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a38b86e606184c7f\" href=\"?note=a38b86e606184c7f\" title=\"27-df-minmaxsupport\">27-df-minmaxsupport</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abdabeb50455fed9\" href=\"?note=abdabeb50455fed9\" title=\"27-df-readoncefunc\">27-df-readoncefunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2258152dd7a3f9d8\" href=\"?note=2258152dd7a3f9d8\" title=\"27-thm-gurvich\">27-thm-gurvich</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.6 Lemma 10.6 and steps C.1–C.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"475"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"499"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-lemma-checked-and-exercise-proof-reconstructed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\)</span> 非恒定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in V(f)\">\\(i,j\\in V(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ne j\">\\(i\\ne j\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(f)=(V(f),E(f))\">\\(G(f)=(V(f),E(f))\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7f58350b3b48133a\" href=\"?note=7f58350b3b48133a\" title=\"27-df-cooccurrence\">27-df-cooccurrence</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X(f)\">\\(\\mathcal X(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a38b86e606184c7f\" href=\"?note=a38b86e606184c7f\" title=\"27-df-minmaxsupport\">27-df-minmaxsupport</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_i,D_j\\in\\mathcal X(f)\">\\(D_i,D_j\\in\\mathcal X(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in D_i\">\\(i\\in D_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in D_j\">\\(j\\in D_j\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{ij}\">\\(R_{ij}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_R\">\\(\\mathbf1_R\\)</span> 由下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_R\">\\(\\chi_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M(f)\">\\(\\mathcal M(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a38b86e606184c7f\" href=\"?note=a38b86e606184c7f\" title=\"27-df-minmaxsupport\">27-df-minmaxsupport</a>；唯一交点判据见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2258152dd7a3f9d8\" href=\"?note=2258152dd7a3f9d8\" title=\"27-thm-gurvich\">27-thm-gurvich</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_{ij}\\coloneqq([n]\\setminus(D_i\\cup D_j))\\cup\\{i,j\\},\\qquad\\mathbf1_R\\coloneqq\\chi_R\\quad(R\\subseteq[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_{ij}\\coloneqq([n]\\setminus(D_i\\cup D_j))\\cup\\{i,j\\},\\qquad\\mathbf1_R\\coloneqq\\chi_R\\quad(R\\subseteq[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"j\\in D_i\\lor i\\in D_j\\Rightarrow\\{i,j\\}\\notin E(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[j\\in D_i\\lor i\\in D_j\\Rightarrow\\{i,j\\}\\notin E(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"j\\notin D_i\\land i\\notin D_j\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\{i,j\\}\\in E(f)\\Longleftrightarrow f(\\mathbf1_{R_{ij}})=1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[j\\notin D_i\\land i\\notin D_j\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\{i,j\\}\\in E(f)\\Longleftrightarrow f(\\mathbf1_{R_{ij}})=1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 10.6 和步骤C.1–C.2，印刷 p.475／PDF p.499。由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2258152dd7a3f9d8\" href=\"?note=2258152dd7a3f9d8\" title=\"27-thm-gurvich\">27-thm-gurvich</a>，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal M(f)\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\)</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathcal X(f)\">\\(D\\in\\mathcal X(f)\\)</span> 恰交一点。因此同属某个双素支持的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\">\\(i,j\\)</span> 不可能共现，给出第一式。</p>\n<p>在第二式的交叉不含前提 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\notin D_i\\land i\\notin D_j\">\\(j\\notin D_i\\land i\\notin D_j\\)</span> 下，两个方向均可直接证明。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\mathbf1_{R_{ij}})=1\">\\(f(\\mathbf1_{R_{ij}})=1\\)</span>，正性与有限性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal M(f)\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq R_{ij}\">\\(P\\subseteq R_{ij}\\)</span>；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{ij}\\cap D_i=\\{i\\}\">\\(R_{ij}\\cap D_i=\\{i\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{ij}\\cap D_j=\\{j\\}\">\\(R_{ij}\\cap D_j=\\{j\\}\\)</span>，两次唯一交点条件迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in P\">\\(i,j\\in P\\)</span>，故两变量相邻。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\">\\(i,j\\)</span> 相邻，取包含二者的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal M(f)\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\)</span>；唯一交点条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\cap D_i=\\{i\\}\">\\(P\\cap D_i=\\{i\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\cap D_j=\\{j\\}\">\\(P\\cap D_j=\\{j\\}\\)</span>，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq R_{ij}\">\\(P\\subseteq R_{ij}\\)</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\mathbf1_{R_{ij}})=1\">\\(f(\\mathbf1_{R_{ij}})=1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原书把 Lemma 10.6 的证明留作 Exercise 14，并提示使用 Theorem 10.6(iv)；这里按该提示内建上述完整推导；该局部推导使用 Gurvich 陈述，不扩张其上游完整证明的核验资格。保留 read-once 承诺，不能据此对任意正函数识别图。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-cooccurrence","status":"resolved","id":"7f58350b3b48133a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cooccurrence]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-minmaxsupport","status":"resolved","id":"a38b86e606184c7f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-minmaxsupport]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readoncefunc","status":"resolved","id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-readoncefunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-gurvich","status":"resolved","id":"2258152dd7a3f9d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-gurvich]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cooccurrence","status":"resolved","id":"7f58350b3b48133a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 非恒定，$i,j\\in V(f)$、$i\\ne j$。$G(f)=(V(f),E(f))$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]，$\\mathcal X(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]。$D_i,D_j\\in\\mathcal X(f)$，$i\\in D_i$、$j\\in D_j$。$R_{ij}$、$\\mathbf1_R$ 由下式构造；$\\chi_R$、$\\mathcal M(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]；唯一交点判据见 [[27-thm-gurvich]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-minmaxsupport","status":"resolved","id":"a38b86e606184c7f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 非恒定，$i,j\\in V(f)$、$i\\ne j$。$G(f)=(V(f),E(f))$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]，$\\mathcal X(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]。$D_i,D_j\\in\\mathcal X(f)$，$i\\in D_i$、$j\\in D_j$。$R_{ij}$、$\\mathbf1_R$ 由下式构造；$\\chi_R$、$\\mathcal M(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]；唯一交点判据见 [[27-thm-gurvich]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-minmaxsupport","status":"resolved","id":"a38b86e606184c7f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 非恒定，$i,j\\in V(f)$、$i\\ne j$。$G(f)=(V(f),E(f))$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]，$\\mathcal X(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]。$D_i,D_j\\in\\mathcal X(f)$，$i\\in D_i$、$j\\in D_j$。$R_{ij}$、$\\mathbf1_R$ 由下式构造；$\\chi_R$、$\\mathcal M(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]；唯一交点判据见 [[27-thm-gurvich]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-gurvich","status":"resolved","id":"2258152dd7a3f9d8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 非恒定，$i,j\\in V(f)$、$i\\ne j$。$G(f)=(V(f),E(f))$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]，$\\mathcal X(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]。$D_i,D_j\\in\\mathcal X(f)$，$i\\in D_i$、$j\\in D_j$。$R_{ij}$、$\\mathbf1_R$ 由下式构造；$\\chi_R$、$\\mathcal M(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]；唯一交点判据见 [[27-thm-gurvich]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-gurvich","status":"resolved","id":"2258152dd7a3f9d8","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Lemma 10.6 和步骤C.1–C.2，印刷 p.475／PDF p.499。由 [[27-thm-gurvich]]，任意 $P\\in\\mathcal M(f)$ 与任意 $D\\in\\mathcal X(f)$ 恰交一点。因此同属某个双素支持的 $i,j$ 不可能共现，给出第一式。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in V(f)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ne j","display":false},{"tex":"G(f)=(V(f),E(f))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal X(f)","display":false},{"tex":"D_i,D_j\\in\\mathcal X(f)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in D_i","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in D_j","display":false},{"tex":"R_{ij}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M(f)","display":false},{"tex":"R_{ij}\\coloneqq([n]\\setminus(D_i\\cup D_j))\\cup\\{i,j\\},\\qquad\\mathbf1_R\\coloneqq\\chi_R\\quad(R\\subseteq[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"j\\in D_i\\lor i\\in D_j\\Rightarrow\\{i,j\\}\\notin E(f).","display":true},{"tex":"j\\notin D_i\\land i\\notin D_j\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\{i,j\\}\\in E(f)\\Longleftrightarrow f(\\mathbf1_{R_{ij}})=1\\right).","display":true},{"tex":